 record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, January to February came in at 23% of normal on the middle and September to October at 57%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 33% and February to March at 50%. Grid 28939 had its driest year in 1976, at 51% of normal.</p>"}
